repository-code: "https://github.com/iarjunganesh/bastion"
abstract: >-
  A three-agent fleet that reviewed Google Cloud IAM access with deterministic policy
  authority, explicit agent handoffs and completion confirmations. v0.9.2 is a source-only
  release; the deployment evaluated in the technical report was v0.9.1. Report and evidence
  records are under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-CONTENT.md).
